Claim Triage Agent
        ↓
Fraud Screening Agent
        ↓
Routing Agent
        ↓
Evidence Review Agent
        ↓
Historical Comparison Agent
        ↓
Damage Assessment Agent
        ↓
Additional Info Agent
        ↓
Inspection Recommendation Agent
        ↓
Loss Estimation Agent
        ↓
Coverage Application Agent
        ↓
Reserve Recommendation Agent
        ↓
Settlement Recommendation Agent
        ↓
Approval Recommendation Agent
        ↓
Payment Trigger Agent

This is the complete Adjuster journey from claim intake → investigation → valuation → coverage determination → reserve calculation → settlement → approval → payment. These last six agents are where the actual financial decision-making of the claim happens.
